  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educational Network Expansion and Improvement Project of the Municipal Public Network of Manaus - PROEMEM II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Expansin y Mejora Educativa de la Red Pblica Municipal de Manaus - PROEMEM II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es mejorar el desempeo y la progresin escolar de los alumnos de Enseanza Fundamental (EF) de la red de educacin del Municipio de Manaos (PdM). Los objetivos especficos son: (i) expandir el acceso a la Educacin Bsica (Educacin Infantil (EI), EF y educacin especial (EE) para estudiantes con Discapacidad (EcD)) con infraestructura resiliente, accesible y conectividad; (ii) mejorar las prcticas pedaggicas y de evaluacin formativa; y (iii) fortalecer las capacidades de la SEMED para gestionar la educacin pblica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to improve the academic performance and progression of elementary school students in the Manaus Municipality (PdM) education system. The specific objectives are: (i) to expand access to basic education (early childhood education, PE, and special education for students with disabilities) through resilient, accessible infrastructure and connectivity; (ii) to improve pedagogical and formative assessment practices; and (iii) to strengthen SEMED&apos;s capacity to manage public education.</narrative>
  </description>
